# The React frontend is a static SPA served by Vite (dev) or any static host (prod).
# All API calls are proxied to the Laravel backend via vite.config.ts.
#
# There is nothing to configure here for admin access anymore — the admin
# dashboard authenticates against the backend with a real email/password
# (POST /api/admin/login), which returns a session token stored only in this
# tab's sessionStorage. No admin secret is ever baked into the build.
